   "explanationHtml": "ב-<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{n^2}</annotation></semantics></math> הניפוח עם <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=2</annotation></semantics></math> נותן אורך <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2+j</annotation></semantics></math> עם <span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le j\\le n</annotation></semantics></math>,</span> שנמצא ממש בין <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math> ל-<span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n+1)^2</annotation></semantics></math>:</span> לא ריבוע. <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>100</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{100}</annotation></semantics></math> באורך קבוע: כש-<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;100</annotation></semantics></math> היא קצרה מדי, ולכן אינה מועילה. <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{n^2+1}</annotation></semantics></math> ו-<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{2n}</annotation></semantics></math> אינן ב-<math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> (למעט ערכים מקריים של <span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math>).</span> (בדקנו עבור <math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2,\\dots,7</annotation></semantics></math> וגם <span class=\"nobr\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=150</annotation></semantics></math>.)</span>",
